<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH PROBE POSSIBLE INSIDER TRADING CASE.</title>
<headline>DUTCH PROBE POSSIBLE INSIDER TRADING CASE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amsterdam public prosecutor's office said on Monday it was investigating a possible case of insider trading.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the case involved trading in shares of medical equipment firm Pie Medical in 1995, just before the company was acquired by Philips Electronics NV.</p>
<p>A preliminary investigation had focused on three suspects, including one of Pie Medical's managers, she said.</p>
<p>The public prosecutor would decide on the basis of the preliminary investigation whether or not to launch a prosecution, she added.</p>
